WEBVTT

00:01.427 --> 00:01.967
<b>[gentle music]</b>

00:02.007 --> 00:04.047
<b>♪ ♪</b>

00:04.097 --> 00:05.847
<b>All right, Julius,
you need to stay here</b>

00:05.887 --> 00:07.637
<b>and rest until
you've finished healing</b>

00:08.137 --> 00:09.767
<b>no matter what!</b>

00:09.807 --> 00:11.307
<b>You heard her.</b>

00:11.357 --> 00:12.767
<b>Yes, of course.</b>

00:12.807 --> 00:14.687
<b>I've already caused
more than enough trouble</b>

00:14.727 --> 00:16.397
<b>for you and Ms. Emelia.</b>

00:16.437 --> 00:18.277
<b>And after all that's
transpired until now,</b>

00:18.317 --> 00:20.987
<b>I wouldn't dare
shamelessly disobey.</b>

00:21.027 --> 00:22.657
<b>I shall be obedient.</b>

00:22.697 --> 00:24.027
<b>Just so you know,
an "understood"</b>

00:24.077 --> 00:25.487
<b>would have sufficed, buddy.</b>

00:25.537 --> 00:26.657
<b>Exactly.</b>

00:26.697 --> 00:28.657
<b>You really don't have
to worry about us.</b>

00:28.707 --> 00:31.497
<b>All we're saying is that
you need to rest properly.</b>

00:31.537 --> 00:33.917
<b>Feel free to trouble us
as much as you want.</b>

00:33.957 --> 00:36.457
<b>'Cause friends help each other.</b>

00:36.497 --> 00:39.917
<b>So, Patrashce, would
you look after Julius?</b>

00:39.967 --> 00:41.757
<b>If anything odd happens
again, call us right away,</b>

00:41.797 --> 00:43.597
<b>and we'll come
as fast as we can.</b>

00:43.637 --> 00:44.637
<b>[murmurs]</b>

00:44.677 --> 00:45.717
<b>See, look.</b>

00:45.757 --> 00:47.017
<b>Even she's saying,
(GRAVELY VOICE)</b>

00:47.057 --> 00:48.057
<b>you better stay in line</b>

00:48.097 --> 00:49.057
<b>'cause I'm not letting you</b>

00:49.097 --> 00:50.097
<b>get away from me next time.</b>

00:50.137 --> 00:52.137
<b>Got it?
- Strangely enough,</b>

00:52.187 --> 00:53.227
<b>I think it really did sound</b>

00:53.267 --> 00:54.267
<b>like those were the words</b>

00:54.307 --> 00:55.267
<b>she was trying to speak.</b>

00:55.307 --> 00:56.477
<b>If I want to be more accurate,</b>

00:56.527 --> 00:57.687
<b>she's a lady,
(HIGH-PITCHED VOICE)</b>

00:57.737 --> 00:59.317
<b>so she'd sound more like this.</b>

00:59.357 --> 01:00.607
<b>[chuckles]</b>

01:00.647 --> 01:02.317
<b>♪ ♪</b>

01:02.357 --> 01:06.327
<b>Yes, I will behave myself
and focus on my recovery.</b>

01:06.367 --> 01:08.157
<b>And after all,
how could I refuse</b>

01:08.197 --> 01:10.867
<b>when afforded the luxury of
resting among maidens as lovely</b>

01:10.917 --> 01:12.167
<b>as these?</b>

01:12.207 --> 01:13.617
<b>[chuckles] Feeling more</b>

01:13.667 --> 01:15.747
<b>like yourself again, I see.</b>

01:20.797 --> 01:22.837
<b>Will Julius be
all right, I suppose?</b>

01:22.887 --> 01:24.217
<b>No need to worry.</b>

01:24.257 --> 01:26.467
<b>Seems he's past
the worst of it already.</b>

01:26.507 --> 01:28.057
<b>After what
Gluttony did to him,</b>

01:28.097 --> 01:29.347
<b>I never would have
thought he'd act so</b>

01:29.387 --> 01:31.227
<b>recklessly in that situation.</b>

01:31.267 --> 01:34.767
<b>Well, I mean, yeah,
I agree with you there.</b>

01:34.807 --> 01:36.937
<b>But what he did was basically
the equivalent of a man</b>

01:36.977 --> 01:38.607
<b>getting a case of the measles.</b>

01:38.647 --> 01:40.107
<b>That was us getting lucky.</b>

01:40.147 --> 01:41.697
<b>It could have meant
failure for all of us</b>

01:41.737 --> 01:43.567
<b>because he acted on his own.</b>

01:43.607 --> 01:45.777
<b>If that had happened,
I'm not sure the examiner</b>

01:45.817 --> 01:47.197
<b>on the second floor
would have let us</b>

01:47.237 --> 01:49.157
<b>leave that place unscathed.</b>

01:50.037 --> 01:52.867
<b>Us, including
the sage imposter.</b>

01:52.917 --> 01:54.037
<b>Who, me?</b>

01:54.077 --> 01:55.077
<b>Whoa!</b>

01:55.117 --> 01:56.497
<b>That's super mean to say.</b>

01:56.537 --> 01:59.457
<b>For starters, I never even
claimed to be a dang sage.</b>

01:59.497 --> 02:01.837
<b>The only name I have is
the one my master gave me,</b>

02:01.877 --> 02:03.377
<b>and that is Shaula, OK?</b>

02:03.427 --> 02:06.217
<b>And I only have eyes for him.</b>

02:06.257 --> 02:07.387
<b>Well, you heard her.</b>

02:07.427 --> 02:09.007
<b>What devotion.</b>

02:09.057 --> 02:12.307
<b>Anyway, the point is, his
mistake wasn't a fatal one.</b>

02:12.347 --> 02:13.637
<b>Just take the win, OK?</b>

02:13.687 --> 02:16.307
<b>[scoffs] Whatever.</b>

02:16.347 --> 02:18.517
<b>I just don't want anyone
getting in my way.</b>

02:18.567 --> 02:19.857
<b>[MEILI] Do you two
want to stand here</b>

02:19.897 --> 02:21.397
<b>and keep fighting forever?</b>

02:21.437 --> 02:24.527
<b>Even I can't deal with
watching this much longer.</b>

02:25.147 --> 02:28.237
<b>[sighs] You're right.</b>

02:28.277 --> 02:30.907
<b>What we need to do right
now is come up with a plan.</b>

02:30.947 --> 02:33.197
<b>Before Julius
completely recovers,</b>

02:33.247 --> 02:35.117
<b>we need to find out a way
to pass the second exam</b>

02:35.157 --> 02:36.707
<b>that works for all of us.</b>

02:36.747 --> 02:38.377
<b>There was a reason
the examiner</b>

02:38.417 --> 02:39.837
<b>acknowledged Ms. Emelia.</b>

02:39.877 --> 02:41.377
<b>It was because
she got information</b>

02:41.417 --> 02:45.217
<b>out of him while fulfilling
his terms in the process.</b>

02:45.257 --> 02:47.467
<b>That said, the conditions
for passing this exam</b>

02:47.507 --> 02:49.097
<b>are rather fickle.</b>

02:49.137 --> 02:51.507
<b>Yeah, it's nasty
in a totally different way</b>

02:51.557 --> 02:53.017
<b>than the third-floor exam, huh?</b>

02:53.057 --> 02:54.477
<b>[SHAULA] Ain't nothing
wrong with that.</b>

02:54.517 --> 02:56.517
<b>Yeah, no need to rush.
Just take it slow.</b>

02:56.557 --> 02:57.557
<b>Chillax.</b>

02:57.597 --> 02:59.767
<b>Going slow
isn't really an option.</b>

02:59.817 --> 03:02.817
<b>My master and all his
friends are welcome here.</b>

03:02.857 --> 03:05.397
<b>And they can stay
as long as they want.</b>

03:05.447 --> 03:06.447
<b>[grunts]</b>

03:06.487 --> 03:07.987
<b>Hey, in case you forgot,</b>

03:08.027 --> 03:10.947
<b>I waited hundreds of years
for you to finally come back.</b>

03:10.987 --> 03:12.487
<b>Uh, yeah, but--</b>

03:12.537 --> 03:14.657
<b>So I think you can spend
a teensy bit of extra time</b>

03:14.697 --> 03:17.667
<b>around here and pass the exams
the legit way, you know?</b>

03:18.747 --> 03:22.547
<b>And in the meantime,
I will watch over you,</b>

03:22.587 --> 03:26.217
<b>whether it takes
days, years, or centuries.</b>

03:26.257 --> 03:28.757
<b>Just make sure you have
a little fun with me</b>

03:28.797 --> 03:30.387
<b>here before leaving again.</b>

03:31.967 --> 03:33.217
<b>Shaula.</b>

03:33.677 --> 03:35.427
<b>[growling]</b>

03:36.517 --> 03:37.767
<b>Uh.</b>

03:39.147 --> 03:41.397
<b>[whimsical music]</b>

03:41.437 --> 03:44.397
<b>[laughs] This looks good.</b>

03:45.607 --> 03:47.567
<b>These past two days,
you must have been</b>

03:47.607 --> 03:50.157
<b>pretty anxious while I
was out of commission, huh?</b>

03:50.197 --> 03:51.777
<b>So there's no need to hesitate.</b>

03:51.817 --> 03:53.737
<b>You can hang all over me
to your heart's content.</b>

03:53.787 --> 03:54.947
<b>Now, don't be ridiculous.</b>

03:54.997 --> 03:56.247
<b>It isn't like that.</b>

03:56.287 --> 03:58.247
<b>My only purpose
for physical contact</b>

03:58.287 --> 04:00.287
<b>is to collect extra mana
to make up for the time</b>

04:00.327 --> 04:02.207
<b>you spent sleeping, I suppose.</b>

04:02.247 --> 04:03.417
<b>I get that.</b>

04:03.457 --> 04:04.547
<b>But then why did you also</b>

04:04.587 --> 04:05.797
<b>hold my hand while I was asleep</b>

04:05.837 --> 04:08.927
<b>and you couldn't even
collect any mana?</b>

04:08.967 --> 04:12.137
<b>Uh, that had nothing
to do with mana.</b>

04:12.177 --> 04:14.637
<b>It was simply necessary
to keep Betty's heart filled,</b>

04:14.677 --> 04:16.307
<b>and it's unrelated to this.</b>

04:16.347 --> 04:18.847
<b>Ah, there's no need
to worry about me, Beako.</b>

04:18.887 --> 04:22.017
<b>Go right ahead and fatten
yourself up on my mana, OK?</b>

04:22.057 --> 04:24.687
<b>It doesn't matter how
much mana I'm absorbing.</b>

04:24.727 --> 04:27.737
<b>It's not going to make me get
fat or anything, I suppose.</b>

04:27.777 --> 04:30.567
<b>All right, that's
enough, you two.</b>

04:30.607 --> 04:32.777
<b>Now let's dig in.</b>

04:32.817 --> 04:36.117
<b>Today, Mom and I prepared
the meal together.</b>

04:36.157 --> 04:38.827
<b>We'll have to make sure
to take some to Julius later.</b>

04:40.077 --> 04:41.537
<b>[munching]</b>

04:43.997 --> 04:45.627
<b>I'm not surprised.</b>

04:45.667 --> 04:47.667
<b>In fact, I kind of
expected as much.</b>

04:47.707 --> 04:50.427
<b>You have the worst table
manners I've seen in my life.</b>

04:50.467 --> 04:53.297
<b>Has it been that long
since you've had any food?</b>

04:53.337 --> 04:56.257
<b>Nah, it's just this
stuff is too hecka tasty.</b>

04:56.307 --> 04:58.137
<b>What did you
usually eat before?</b>

04:58.177 --> 04:59.477
<b>[SHAULA]
Mabeasts and stuff.</b>

04:59.517 --> 05:01.767
<b>You mean like those
giant worms in the desert?</b>

05:01.807 --> 05:04.897
<b>And stuff like bears
and horses too sometimes.</b>

05:04.937 --> 05:06.977
<b>I never thought I was
the type to be too particular</b>

05:07.017 --> 05:08.487
<b>about food, to be honest.</b>

05:08.527 --> 05:10.237
<b>But if it can be made
to taste this good,</b>

05:10.277 --> 05:12.657
<b>then I might become
the half witch's apprentice.</b>

05:12.697 --> 05:15.277
<b>You'd want to become
my apprentice?</b>

05:15.317 --> 05:16.447
<b>To cook?</b>

05:16.487 --> 05:18.617
<b>I want to get super-duper
good at cooking.</b>

05:18.657 --> 05:21.077
<b>Then when I win master's
heart through his stomach,</b>

05:21.117 --> 05:22.667
<b>I won't let you sleep tonight.</b>

05:22.707 --> 05:24.167
<b>Yeah!</b>

05:24.207 --> 05:26.297
<b>Shame's not in her vocabulary.</b>

05:29.417 --> 05:32.217
<b>[BETTY] Subaru, Betty will
be staying in the carriage</b>

05:32.257 --> 05:34.137
<b>along with Emelia and Rom.</b>

05:34.177 --> 05:35.547
<b>Sure, that sounds good.</b>

05:35.587 --> 05:37.097
<b>But don't stay up all night.</b>

05:37.137 --> 05:38.307
<b>It'll hinder
your growth, and then</b>

05:38.347 --> 05:40.717
<b>you'll end up being
a shrimp forever.</b>

05:40.767 --> 05:42.977
<b>[gasps] You'd be adorable.</b>

05:43.017 --> 05:45.057
<b>All right, stay up all
night, then, Beako.</b>

05:45.107 --> 05:48.107
<b>[sighs] Well, not to worry.</b>

05:48.147 --> 05:51.027
<b>Betty will never get any bigger
than this anyway, I suppose.</b>

05:51.067 --> 05:54.397
<b>No matter what, I will remain
this cute always and forever.</b>

05:54.447 --> 05:57.027
<b>So I can go to sleep
early, I suppose.</b>

05:57.067 --> 05:58.867
<b>OK, Mili, take care of her.</b>

05:58.907 --> 05:59.947
<b>Mm.</b>

05:59.997 --> 06:01.407
<b>Good night then.</b>

06:01.447 --> 06:04.367
<b>And you'd better try not
to stay up too late yourself.</b>

06:06.537 --> 06:08.877
<b>[soft music]</b>

06:08.917 --> 06:11.507
<b>♪ ♪</b>

06:11.547 --> 06:12.797
<b>Hmm.</b>

06:14.297 --> 06:16.137
<b>Subaru, you came back.</b>

06:16.177 --> 06:17.677
<b>Hey, you get a chance to eat?</b>

06:17.717 --> 06:18.677
<b>Yes.</b>

06:18.717 --> 06:20.347
<b>It was lovely.</b>

06:20.387 --> 06:22.137
<b>Here to watch over Ms. Rem?</b>

06:22.177 --> 06:25.387
<b>[sighs] Yeah,
that was the plan.</b>

06:25.437 --> 06:27.397
<b>Do you want to
take over tonight?</b>

06:28.817 --> 06:29.687
<b>No.</b>

06:30.977 --> 06:34.107
<b>You were unconscious for two
days until this morning.</b>

06:34.147 --> 06:37.317
<b>I'm sure she has also been
longing for night to come.</b>

06:37.367 --> 06:39.327
<b>Well, if you want
to let me do it,</b>

06:39.367 --> 06:42.697
<b>then I'm not going to waste
time arguing with you.</b>

06:42.747 --> 06:44.657
<b>But you sure it's OK?</b>

06:44.707 --> 06:47.077
<b>The truth is
that I would prefer</b>

06:47.127 --> 06:50.337
<b>to stay by Ms. Anastasia's
side until she wakes.</b>

06:50.377 --> 06:53.257
<b>But then when
she does awaken,</b>

06:53.297 --> 06:56.297
<b>I am unsure
of what I should say to her.</b>

06:56.337 --> 06:57.967
<b>My hesitation holds me back.</b>

06:58.007 --> 06:59.047
<b>It should be simple.</b>

06:59.097 --> 07:00.467
<b>I've been worried
about you, and I'm</b>

07:00.507 --> 07:02.507
<b>so glad you're finally awake.</b>

07:02.557 --> 07:03.927
<b>Don't you think?</b>

07:03.967 --> 07:06.557
<b>The question is what
you should say after that.</b>

07:07.807 --> 07:10.397
<b>You have such a free
spirited way of thinking.</b>

07:10.437 --> 07:12.687
<b>I quite envy you for that.</b>

07:13.647 --> 07:15.897
<b>Perhaps I'll leave
it to you tonight.</b>

07:15.947 --> 07:18.567
<b>I will return
to the carriage to rest.</b>

07:18.617 --> 07:21.027
<b>Today has been a bit
exhausting, after all.</b>

07:21.077 --> 07:22.987
<b>Julius! Actually, I think</b>

07:23.037 --> 07:24.157
<b>you should stay here and wait</b>

07:24.197 --> 07:25.867
<b>for Ms. Anastasia to wake up.</b>

07:25.907 --> 07:27.077
<b>I'll come wake you up</b>

07:27.117 --> 07:28.457
<b>once I've finished
what I need to do.</b>

07:28.497 --> 07:35.797
<b>♪ ♪</b>

07:38.387 --> 07:40.887
<b>Rem longed
for the night to come, huh?</b>

07:40.927 --> 07:42.137
<b>That's what Julius said.</b>

07:42.177 --> 07:43.427
<b>But...</b>

07:48.227 --> 07:50.397
<b>[murmurs]</b>

07:53.267 --> 07:54.987
<b>[growls]</b>

07:58.527 --> 07:59.487
<b>Oh, crap.</b>

07:59.527 --> 08:00.617
<b>I fell asleep.</b>

08:00.657 --> 08:01.947
<b>[growls]</b>

08:01.987 --> 08:07.117
<b>♪ ♪</b>

08:07.157 --> 08:08.787
<b>Uh, Foxidna?</b>

08:08.827 --> 08:11.707
<b>[eerie music]</b>

08:11.747 --> 08:12.957
<b>[gasps]</b>

08:15.257 --> 08:17.207
<b>Why is there
a bird inside the tower?</b>

08:17.257 --> 08:20.757
<b>♪ ♪</b>

08:20.797 --> 08:23.257
<b>[fluttering]</b>

08:23.307 --> 08:25.717
<b>[panting]</b>

08:25.757 --> 08:33.017
<b>♪ ♪</b>

08:45.237 --> 08:46.697
<b>It vanished?</b>

08:49.247 --> 08:50.497
<b>What?
That can't be.</b>

08:50.537 --> 08:57.087
<b>♪ ♪</b>

08:57.127 --> 08:58.377
<b>Feather.</b>

09:01.337 --> 09:04.347
<b>Is there something
hidden in the wall?</b>

09:06.217 --> 09:07.637
<b>[gulps]</b>

09:07.677 --> 09:14.307
<b>♪ ♪</b>

09:19.897 --> 09:21.277
<b>[grunts]</b>

09:21.317 --> 09:26.777
<b>♪ ♪</b>

09:30.617 --> 09:32.157
<b>Foxidna.
- Huh?</b>

09:36.787 --> 09:38.047
<b>Natsuki?</b>

09:38.917 --> 09:40.377
<b>This sure is the perfect view</b>

09:40.417 --> 09:43.047
<b>for taking
a moonlit stroll, isn't it?</b>

09:43.087 --> 09:44.507
<b>Sure is.</b>

09:44.547 --> 09:46.797
<b>It's just a shame you can't
see much at the moment.</b>

09:46.847 --> 09:48.387
<b>That beautiful
view beyond here is</b>

09:48.427 --> 09:50.307
<b>covered up in total darkness.</b>

09:50.347 --> 09:53.017
<b>Sure, it's a little different
at night, but I'm still a fan.</b>

09:53.057 --> 09:55.147
<b>It's like an ocean.</b>

09:55.187 --> 09:57.767
<b>And also, above all else,</b>

09:57.807 --> 09:59.777
<b>the air is so clear
and cool out here,</b>

09:59.817 --> 10:01.987
<b>the stars seem
to shine even brighter.</b>

10:02.027 --> 10:03.527
<b>Romantic, isn't it?</b>

10:04.817 --> 10:07.367
<b>Well, I can't deny how
beautiful the stars are.</b>

10:07.407 --> 10:10.407
<b>So what's your excuse
for this situation?</b>

10:10.447 --> 10:11.907
<b>[FOXIDNA]
Excuse me?</b>

10:11.957 --> 10:13.077
<b>For slipping out of your room</b>

10:13.117 --> 10:14.957
<b>in the middle of the night
without a word</b>

10:14.997 --> 10:16.327
<b>taking a secret passage
in the wall</b>

10:16.377 --> 10:18.287
<b>nobody else knows
about, and coming</b>

10:18.337 --> 10:20.127
<b>outside on the balcony
to play with a bunch</b>

10:20.167 --> 10:22.467
<b>of birds in the night breeze.</b>

10:22.507 --> 10:24.717
<b>It's way too suspicious.</b>

10:24.757 --> 10:26.427
<b>I think you might
be exaggerating a bit</b>

10:26.467 --> 10:28.217
<b>about the secret passage.</b>

10:28.257 --> 10:30.597
<b>I mean, you managed
to find it, didn't you?</b>

10:30.637 --> 10:34.847
<b>That was only because one of
the birds kind of led me here.</b>

10:34.887 --> 10:37.187
<b>Well, that's the same
thing that happened to me.</b>

10:37.227 --> 10:38.897
<b>I was just taking
an aimless midnight</b>

10:38.937 --> 10:40.727
<b>stroll around the tower.</b>

10:40.767 --> 10:43.487
<b>And then I saw a bird
flying in the hall.</b>

10:43.527 --> 10:44.947
<b>I was so curious, I followed it</b>

10:44.987 --> 10:46.407
<b>and ended up here.</b>

10:46.987 --> 10:48.157
<b>Huh.</b>

10:48.197 --> 10:50.077
<b>I wonder, are these
the same birds</b>

10:50.117 --> 10:51.617
<b>we saw flying when
we were trying</b>

10:51.657 --> 10:53.367
<b>to overcome the Sand Time?</b>

10:55.077 --> 10:57.537
<b>You got it, the ones Rom
looked through the eyes of when</b>

10:57.577 --> 11:00.037
<b>using her clairvoyance.</b>

11:00.087 --> 11:03.667
<b>Oh, though I've been curious
about their behavior.</b>

11:03.707 --> 11:05.507
<b>I find it to be
incredibly puzzling.</b>

11:06.637 --> 11:08.507
<b>Right now, you and I
are the only two people</b>

11:08.547 --> 11:10.757
<b>out here in hearing distance.</b>

11:10.797 --> 11:12.807
<b>So why don't we speak frankly?</b>

11:14.477 --> 11:17.267
<b>Not with the me who's
pretending to be Ana,</b>

11:17.307 --> 11:19.517
<b>but instead with the actual me?</b>

11:21.317 --> 11:22.687
<b>That's perfect.</b>

11:22.727 --> 11:23.857
<b>There's something on my mind</b>

11:23.897 --> 11:25.777
<b>I wanted to ask you.</b>

11:25.817 --> 11:27.527
<b>You have a question for me?</b>

11:27.567 --> 11:31.447
<b>Subaru Natsuki, just
who exactly are you?</b>

11:31.487 --> 11:33.697
<b>I'm not sure I follow.</b>

11:33.737 --> 11:35.657
<b>After the big
celebration of your victory</b>

11:35.697 --> 11:39.077
<b>over the White Whale,
and Sloth as well,</b>

11:39.127 --> 11:42.037
<b>Ana went to investigate
you thoroughly.</b>

11:42.087 --> 11:44.917
<b>But she couldn't figure
out your background.</b>

11:44.957 --> 11:47.967
<b>She grumbled about only being
able to learn the bare minimum</b>

11:48.007 --> 11:50.217
<b>despite her best efforts.</b>

11:50.257 --> 11:54.137
<b>The farthest she uncovered
was before the royal selection,</b>

11:54.177 --> 11:55.847
<b>when you had apparently
been involved</b>

11:55.887 --> 11:58.687
<b>in a bit of an incident
within the royal capital.</b>

11:59.477 --> 12:01.937
<b>Again, who exactly are you?</b>

12:01.977 --> 12:05.277
<b>[melancholy music]</b>

12:05.317 --> 12:06.737
<b>Hold on.</b>

12:06.777 --> 12:08.817
<b>Are you seriously afraid of me?</b>

12:08.857 --> 12:13.407
<b>I-- the fact that you would
say such a thing is upsetting.</b>

12:13.447 --> 12:15.997
<b>Tell me, what is the truth
about your connection</b>

12:16.037 --> 12:17.367
<b>to Shaula?</b>

12:17.407 --> 12:18.537
<b>The first time I met her was</b>

12:18.577 --> 12:20.207
<b>after we came here together.</b>

12:20.247 --> 12:22.127
<b>She was a stranger.</b>

12:22.167 --> 12:24.997
<b>During the third-floor exam,
was it just a coincidence</b>

12:25.047 --> 12:26.547
<b>that you figured out the puzzle</b>

12:26.587 --> 12:27.877
<b>so quickly?</b>

12:28.757 --> 12:30.677
<b>It really was.</b>

12:30.717 --> 12:32.387
<b>And what about these birds?</b>

12:33.637 --> 12:34.967
<b>No clue.</b>

12:35.007 --> 12:36.927
<b>I'm a bit afraid to just
take your word for it</b>

12:36.967 --> 12:38.727
<b>without any further proof.</b>

12:38.767 --> 12:40.347
<b>I have a question
to ask as well.</b>

12:40.387 --> 12:43.147
<b>What's going on with
Ms. Anastasia?</b>

12:44.977 --> 12:47.187
<b>There's no change
in her condition,</b>

12:47.237 --> 12:50.067
<b>meaning, just as before,
Ana is still sleeping</b>

12:50.107 --> 12:52.027
<b>deep within this body.</b>

12:52.067 --> 12:54.577
<b>I'm not being optimistic
here or anything.</b>

12:54.617 --> 12:56.947
<b>But the knowledge that I'm
chipping away at her life</b>

12:56.987 --> 12:59.367
<b>steadily weighs on me.</b>

12:59.407 --> 13:01.077
<b>[gasps]</b>

13:01.117 --> 13:03.627
<b>[FOXIDNA] Which is why
I can't waste any more time.</b>

13:03.667 --> 13:07.457
<b>I need to return her body
to her as soon as possible.</b>

13:07.507 --> 13:09.047
<b>In that state, though?</b>

13:09.087 --> 13:10.877
<b>She's barely even surviving.</b>

13:10.917 --> 13:13.007
<b>How could she rule
an entire kingdom?</b>

13:13.047 --> 13:15.047
<b>Ana will never concede.</b>

13:15.097 --> 13:16.717
<b>Nothing could make her give up.</b>

13:17.847 --> 13:20.637
<b>I know that with certainty.</b>

13:20.677 --> 13:23.847
<b>Does Ms. Anastasia want to be
in charge of her own country</b>

13:23.897 --> 13:25.057
<b>that badly?</b>

13:25.107 --> 13:26.807
<b>What if it means
she has to let it go</b>

13:26.857 --> 13:28.607
<b>as soon as she gets
her hands on it?</b>

13:28.647 --> 13:30.437
<b>Yes, even then.
Ana has a reason</b>

13:30.487 --> 13:32.487
<b>she can't give up
on the throne,</b>

13:32.527 --> 13:34.237
<b>whatever it takes.</b>

13:34.277 --> 13:37.487
<b>[wind whistling]</b>

13:37.527 --> 13:40.997
<b>[JULIUS] Care to explain
what you meant by that?</b>

13:41.037 --> 13:41.957
<b>[gasps]</b>

13:41.997 --> 13:44.667
<b>[fluttering]</b>

13:52.337 --> 13:55.637
<b>I need you to explain to me
what you meant by that.</b>

13:55.677 --> 13:57.217
<b>[sighs]</b>

13:58.307 --> 14:00.017
<b>I'm sorry, Julius.</b>

14:00.057 --> 14:01.677
<b>But it's not as if
I was trying to leave</b>

14:01.727 --> 14:03.637
<b>you in the dark or anything.</b>

14:03.687 --> 14:05.147
<b>I was just chatting
with Natsuki</b>

14:05.187 --> 14:06.227
<b>about what we're
all going to have</b>

14:06.267 --> 14:08.057
<b>to think about
when we get back home</b>

14:08.107 --> 14:10.187
<b>after finishing up
this mission.</b>

14:10.227 --> 14:12.107
<b>So, forgive me?</b>

14:12.147 --> 14:14.277
<b>You're not Ms. Anastasia.</b>

14:14.317 --> 14:16.617
<b>You're someone else.</b>

14:16.657 --> 14:18.697
<b>I want you to tell
me everything.</b>

14:18.737 --> 14:19.787
<b>Know this.</b>

14:19.827 --> 14:21.537
<b>You will not
fool me any longer.</b>

14:21.577 --> 14:22.577
<b>Julius, wait.</b>

14:22.617 --> 14:23.867
<b>Hold on!
- Subaru</b>

14:23.907 --> 14:25.667
<b>I'll hear from you too.</b>

14:25.707 --> 14:28.377
<b>The full and complete
truth is all I will accept.</b>

14:30.337 --> 14:32.507
<b>When did you start listening?</b>

14:32.547 --> 14:34.167
<b>From around
when Ms. Anastasia's body</b>

14:34.217 --> 14:35.297
<b>was mentioned.</b>

14:35.337 --> 14:36.587
<b>Oh.</b>

14:38.137 --> 14:41.637
<b>[sighs] I am an artificial
spirit who's been with Ana</b>

14:41.677 --> 14:43.767
<b>for many years already.</b>

14:43.807 --> 14:46.477
<b>My name is Echidna.</b>

14:46.517 --> 14:49.647
<b>Ever since the battle against
the witch cult in Priestella,</b>

14:49.687 --> 14:52.107
<b>Ana's consciousness
has been slumbering deep</b>

14:52.147 --> 14:52.987
<b>within this body.</b>

14:54.067 --> 14:55.947
<b>Meaning she's not
the one making her body</b>

14:55.987 --> 14:58.117
<b>move and speak at the moment.</b>

14:58.157 --> 15:00.407
<b>I've been pretending
to be Ana, and it's</b>

15:00.447 --> 15:02.497
<b>been that way for a while.</b>

15:02.537 --> 15:04.497
<b>[JULIUS] And why did
you choose to only share</b>

15:04.537 --> 15:06.327
<b>this knowledge with Subaru?</b>

15:07.667 --> 15:10.287
<b>[ECHIDNA] That was because he
managed to figure out</b>

15:10.337 --> 15:12.257
<b>that I was a fake on his own.</b>

15:12.297 --> 15:13.667
<b>I had to tell him.</b>

15:14.877 --> 15:16.427
<b>He barely knows her.</b>

15:16.467 --> 15:19.637
<b>How's an outsider able
to notice the difference,</b>

15:19.677 --> 15:21.677
<b>while the man who calls
himself her first knight</b>

15:21.717 --> 15:23.517
<b>failed to recognize
such an important thing?</b>

15:23.557 --> 15:24.927
<b>Just hang on.
Listen!</b>

15:24.977 --> 15:26.347
<b>The only reason
I figured it out</b>

15:26.387 --> 15:27.847
<b>was because, well, it
was only a coincidence.</b>

15:27.897 --> 15:28.857
<b>OK?</b>

15:28.897 --> 15:30.687
<b>Recognizing such coincidences</b>

15:30.727 --> 15:32.607
<b>and turning them
into something definite</b>

15:32.647 --> 15:34.067
<b>is a first knight's duty.</b>

15:34.107 --> 15:35.937
<b>What is a first knight anyway?</b>

15:35.987 --> 15:37.737
<b>If that's what it means,
who needs a stupid--</b>

15:37.777 --> 15:41.077
<b>Do not suggest
I throw it away.</b>

15:42.237 --> 15:43.487
<b>I can't.</b>

15:44.197 --> 15:45.497
<b>Right now, I--</b>

15:46.367 --> 15:47.787
<b>I am terrified by the thought</b>

15:47.827 --> 15:49.957
<b>of letting even
one thing slip away.</b>

15:51.587 --> 15:53.417
<b>Back to the subject.</b>

15:53.457 --> 15:55.717
<b>Echidna, tell me what
your objective is here.</b>

15:56.757 --> 15:59.427
<b>I only wish to return
this body to Ana.</b>

15:59.467 --> 16:02.097
<b>Which means the situation
that you're currently in</b>

16:02.137 --> 16:04.177
<b>is not what you desired.</b>

16:04.217 --> 16:07.097
<b>And you have yet
to discover a way to return</b>

16:07.137 --> 16:08.727
<b>Ms. Anastasia's body to her.</b>

16:10.097 --> 16:12.357
<b>Know that if my death would
allow Ana to live longer...</b>

16:13.607 --> 16:16.817
<b>then I would not hesitate
to accept that outcome.</b>

16:16.857 --> 16:18.237
<b>Help me understand.</b>

16:18.277 --> 16:21.277
<b>Why would you sacrifice
so much for her sake?</b>

16:21.317 --> 16:23.777
<b>It's simply because I love Ana.</b>

16:23.827 --> 16:25.907
<b>Ever since this little
one was very young,</b>

16:25.947 --> 16:28.247
<b>I've been by her side,
supporting her.</b>

16:28.287 --> 16:30.247
<b>So abandoning her
is not an option.</b>

16:30.287 --> 16:31.747
<b>I want her to be happy.</b>

16:32.787 --> 16:34.337
<b>And that is my reason.</b>

16:34.377 --> 16:39.797
<b>♪ ♪</b>

16:39.837 --> 16:43.387
<b>I'm glad you decided to make
such a rational decision.</b>

16:43.427 --> 16:46.977
<b>Ana would certainly be quite
happy with your choice as well.</b>

16:47.007 --> 16:48.847
<b>[metal scraping]</b>

16:48.887 --> 16:50.437
<b>One more thing.</b>

16:50.477 --> 16:53.107
<b>If you keep using
Ms. Anastasia's Od this way</b>

16:53.147 --> 16:55.897
<b>to continually manifest,
then that would also mean,</b>

16:55.937 --> 16:57.397
<b>the more you push
yourself, the more</b>

16:57.437 --> 16:59.567
<b>strain you put on her body.</b>

16:59.607 --> 17:00.857
<b>Yes, you're right.</b>

17:00.897 --> 17:02.567
<b>You perceive that correctly.</b>

17:02.617 --> 17:05.197
<b>If that's true,
on the second floor,</b>

17:05.237 --> 17:07.077
<b>why did you act so recklessly?</b>

17:07.947 --> 17:09.037
<b>Oh.</b>

17:09.077 --> 17:10.247
<b>[JULIUS]
Based on what I saw,</b>

17:10.287 --> 17:11.497
<b>the strain that was
put on her body</b>

17:11.537 --> 17:13.037
<b>while you cast
spell after spell</b>

17:13.077 --> 17:14.587
<b>could not have been trivial.</b>

17:15.627 --> 17:17.087
<b>So what was the purpose?</b>

17:17.957 --> 17:21.377
<b>For that, I apologize.</b>

17:22.587 --> 17:25.717
<b>That was my mistake
and a miscalculation.</b>

17:25.757 --> 17:28.717
<b>But it was a decision made
from a strategic point of view.</b>

17:28.767 --> 17:31.097
<b>Strategic in what way?</b>

17:31.137 --> 17:32.727
<b>[ECHIDNA]
At the time, I didn't yet know</b>

17:32.767 --> 17:34.767
<b>whether that examiner
was out for blood or not.</b>

17:35.937 --> 17:38.397
<b>One wrong action,
and we might have lost you,</b>

17:38.437 --> 17:40.527
<b>one of our strongest assets.</b>

17:40.567 --> 17:42.527
<b>I wanted to avoid that.</b>

17:42.567 --> 17:44.157
<b>And for Ana's sake also.</b>

17:44.907 --> 17:46.487
<b>Understood.
- [gulps]</b>

17:46.527 --> 17:48.787
<b>But please refrain
from acting rashly,</b>

17:48.827 --> 17:51.657
<b>if only
for Ms. Anastasia's sake.</b>

17:52.747 --> 17:53.707
<b>Understood.</b>

17:53.747 --> 17:54.787
<b>What?</b>

17:54.827 --> 17:56.747
<b>That was enough
to convince you?</b>

17:56.787 --> 17:58.837
<b>Yes, it was indeed.</b>

17:58.877 --> 18:02.627
<b>Apologies for involving you in
this strange misunderstanding.</b>

18:02.667 --> 18:06.137
<b>However, this problem shall
remain strictly our own.</b>

18:06.177 --> 18:08.637
<b>It is nothing you need
to concern yourself over.</b>

18:08.677 --> 18:10.807
<b>You can't decide
what I worry about.</b>

18:10.847 --> 18:12.137
<b>I'll make my own judgments.</b>

18:12.177 --> 18:13.557
<b>So you're allowed to decide,</b>

18:13.597 --> 18:14.937
<b>but I don't get to choose</b>

18:14.977 --> 18:16.897
<b>how I handle my own problems?</b>

18:16.937 --> 18:19.357
<b>Just as you didn't tell me
the truth about Ms. Anastasia</b>

18:19.397 --> 18:20.477
<b>and Echidna?</b>

18:20.527 --> 18:21.777
<b>Uh.</b>

18:24.197 --> 18:25.197
<b>Forgive me.</b>

18:25.237 --> 18:26.487
<b>I went too far.</b>

18:27.317 --> 18:28.737
<b>But it is true.</b>

18:28.787 --> 18:31.447
<b>♪ ♪</b>

18:31.487 --> 18:34.537
<b>There is no reason
to stay out here any longer.</b>

18:34.577 --> 18:36.287
<b>Let us go inside.</b>

18:36.327 --> 18:38.707
<b>We shall talk to Ms. Emelia
and the others tomorrow.</b>

18:38.747 --> 18:40.957
<b>We must inform them
of Ms. Anastasia's condition,</b>

18:40.997 --> 18:43.167
<b>as well as Echidna's presence.</b>

18:43.207 --> 18:44.837
<b>Very well.</b>

18:44.877 --> 18:46.797
<b>I too shall steel my resolve.</b>

18:46.837 --> 18:50.427
<b>♪ ♪</b>

18:50.467 --> 18:51.717
<b>Julius.</b>

18:53.677 --> 18:55.517
<b>Don't you have
something you want</b>

18:55.557 --> 18:57.397
<b>to say to me before leaving?</b>

18:57.437 --> 18:58.687
<b>Yes, I do.</b>

18:59.727 --> 19:01.567
<b>I understand.</b>

19:01.607 --> 19:03.737
<b>I understand what
you were thinking</b>

19:03.777 --> 19:05.567
<b>and why you figured
hiding the truth from me</b>

19:05.607 --> 19:07.407
<b>was the best course of action.</b>

19:08.197 --> 19:10.277
<b>You meant no harm in doing so.</b>

19:10.327 --> 19:13.447
<b>It was purely out
of concern and sympathy.</b>

19:13.497 --> 19:16.617
<b>If our positions were reversed,
perhaps I would have refrained</b>

19:16.667 --> 19:18.327
<b>from telling you as well.</b>

19:19.917 --> 19:22.167
<b>However, even still...</b>

19:24.207 --> 19:27.717
<b>I did not want either
Ms. Anastasia or you</b>

19:28.967 --> 19:30.427
<b>to think that I was not worthy</b>

19:30.467 --> 19:32.427
<b>of holding
my title as a knight.</b>

19:34.137 --> 19:36.807
<b>[footsteps echoing]</b>

19:42.147 --> 19:43.397
<b>Barusu.</b>

19:44.647 --> 19:45.987
<b>Hey, Rom.</b>

19:46.027 --> 19:47.487
<b>What are you doing
walking around so late?</b>

19:47.527 --> 19:49.197
<b>Pervert.
- Oh, come on.</b>

19:49.237 --> 19:51.777
<b>Don't try to end the
conversation before it starts.</b>

19:51.827 --> 19:53.367
<b>Hold on, you didn't go upstairs</b>

19:53.407 --> 19:54.657
<b>all by yourself, did you?</b>

19:54.697 --> 19:58.407
<b>Not successfully,
though an attempt was made.</b>

19:58.457 --> 19:59.707
<b>I turned back part way.</b>

19:59.747 --> 20:00.877
<b>Uh.</b>

20:00.917 --> 20:02.917
<b>What were you
doing out and about?</b>

20:02.957 --> 20:05.507
<b>You have an awfully
dejected look on your face.</b>

20:05.547 --> 20:07.717
<b>Did you fight with that
knight Julius or something?</b>

20:07.757 --> 20:08.837
<b>Huh?</b>

20:08.887 --> 20:09.837
<b>Am I that much</b>

20:09.887 --> 20:11.137
<b>of an open book at this point?</b>

20:11.177 --> 20:12.137
<b>That's part of it.</b>

20:12.177 --> 20:13.177
<b>It's also that I am</b>

20:13.217 --> 20:14.677
<b>simply too intelligent.</b>

20:14.717 --> 20:16.387
<b>Well?
- [gulps]</b>

20:17.677 --> 20:19.307
<b>Oh, it's nothing.</b>

20:19.347 --> 20:20.857
<b>Well, no, it wasn't nothing.</b>

20:20.897 --> 20:24.397
<b>But I think I'll be able
to tell you tomorrow.</b>

20:24.437 --> 20:26.897
<b>You sure can talk a lot
without saying a thing.</b>

20:26.937 --> 20:28.947
<b>That's my cue to head
back to the carriage.</b>

20:28.987 --> 20:29.987
<b>Right.</b>

20:30.027 --> 20:31.737
<b>Good night, big sister.</b>

20:31.777 --> 20:34.277
<b>I am not your big
sister, Barusu.</b>

20:34.327 --> 20:36.037
<b>Never call me that again.</b>

20:38.117 --> 20:39.537
<b>[sighs]</b>

20:39.577 --> 20:42.537
<b>Well, I guess
the green room's not an option.</b>

20:42.587 --> 20:44.957
<b>[sighs] So what
should I do instead?</b>

20:46.757 --> 20:48.377
<b>I guess if I can't
sleep anywhere,</b>

20:48.417 --> 20:50.797
<b>I'll try to think of a way
to deal with Reid.</b>

20:54.637 --> 20:55.887
<b>Hmm?</b>

20:59.517 --> 21:00.767
<b>That's it.</b>

21:00.807 --> 21:02.107
<b>If this works, then--</b>

21:03.357 --> 21:06.067
<b>[footsteps echoing]</b>

21:14.157 --> 21:15.367
<b>[EMELIA]
Subaru!</b>

21:15.407 --> 21:17.197
<b>Hey, Subaru!</b>

21:17.237 --> 21:18.487
<b>Are you all right?</b>

21:20.157 --> 21:21.367
<b>Huh?</b>

21:22.577 --> 21:24.457
<b>[exclaims]</b>

21:24.497 --> 21:26.837
<b>[pants] Huh?</b>

21:26.877 --> 21:28.207
<b>Oh, what a relief.</b>

21:28.257 --> 21:30.257
<b>I was really worried about you.</b>

21:30.297 --> 21:32.047
<b>[BETTY] Emelia, you need
to be firmer with him,</b>

21:32.087 --> 21:34.337
<b>or he won't feel bad
about what he's done.</b>

21:34.387 --> 21:35.347
<b>You're right.</b>

21:35.387 --> 21:36.427
<b>Like Beatrice said,</b>

21:36.467 --> 21:37.637
<b>you've been naughty.</b>

21:37.677 --> 21:38.677
<b>She panicked when we</b>

21:38.717 --> 21:40.097
<b>couldn't find you anywhere.</b>

21:40.137 --> 21:41.597
<b>She almost started crying.</b>

21:41.637 --> 21:42.887
<b>We did find you on the ground.</b>

21:42.937 --> 21:44.727
<b>You don't need
to share every little detail</b>

21:44.767 --> 21:46.187
<b>about that with him, I suppose.</b>

21:46.227 --> 21:47.897
<b>[purrs]</b>

21:51.897 --> 21:53.857
<b>[SUBARU] A silver-haired
beauty and a little girl</b>

21:53.907 --> 21:55.197
<b>with ringlets.</b>

21:55.237 --> 21:56.947
<b>A giant lizard and a huge room</b>

21:56.987 --> 21:58.447
<b>covered in living plants.</b>

21:58.487 --> 21:59.447
<b>Hold on.</b>

21:59.487 --> 22:01.117
<b>So does this mean...</b>

22:01.157 --> 22:02.367
<b>Subaru?</b>

22:03.867 --> 22:07.587
<b>I've been summoned across
the universe to another world!</b>

22:12.087 --> 22:14.757
<b>[theme music]</b>

22:14.797 --> 22:20.807
<b>♪ ♪</b>
